  m_text: 'Welcome\n

    You will complete <b>two separate gambling tasks</b> in
    this session.\n

    Each task is <b>independent</b> and will be explained before
    it begins.\n

    Your performance in one task <b>does not affect</b> the other.\n

    Wallet
    set to <color=green><b>$25</b></color>.'
